    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δήω</span></b>  (A), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>find, meet with,</i> always in pres. (exc.
